          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a7e0-82f3-82c5-79c8">Whenever Aun&apos;Va&apos;s unit suffers one or more unsaved Wounds from a shooting attack, roll a D6. If the result is equal to or greater than that attack&apos;s AP, the Wound is discounted as if a cover save had been passed. This cannot be used against AP- attacks.</characteristic>
